        "Changes with place",
        "SI unit = Newton",
        "Vector quantity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w7qom38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Formula of Weight"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uvgghq2",
      "content": "Weight = Mass × Acceleration due to gravity W = mg"
    },
    {
